{
  "_comment": "Confluent Cloud fully-managed HTTP Source V2 connector. Easiest path: Cluster ▸ Connectors ▸ 'HTTP Source V2' — the wizard first asks for an OpenAPI spec (upload connectors/coinbase-openapi.yaml), then enter these values. See README step 2.",
  "name": "coinbase-spot-prices",
